cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "M19: A nonuniform-direction-net lower bound for 17 unit squares in a square"
message: "Please cite a fixed commit or release of this evidence snapshot; see NOTICE.md for upstream attribution."
type: software
version: "0.1.0-m19"
authors:
  - name: "Guzhou0806"
abstract: >-
  Evidence, exact coverage replays and proof of the M19 lower-bound constant
  4.59004266897263595052... for seventeen rotatable unit squares in a square.
  Based on Joshua Levy's weighted-atom certificate and dilation-limit method.
  No external-priority or optimality claim is made.
keywords:
  - square packing
  - computer-assisted proof
  - lower bound
  - exact arithmetic
